{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daming: Sheji Roulette is a Roguelite style game that uses the development roulette wheel to help your town prosper, collect more taxes, meet the requirements of the emperor, and ultimately hold high positions and serve as a powerful minister. The level script of this game corresponds to major historical nodes of the Ming Dynasty, adding different fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912520/extras/a469d93165f761af3acb4fa707d7a717.avif?t=1756112342\" width=600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is your duty to serve as a father and mother official and benefit the people of the region. But collecting taxes and silver for the Ming Dynasty is the shortcut to promotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize development opportunities to continuously collect tax silver from various characters and buildings!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912520/extras/c190b84d0c6a99f616c7a0cfebadaefe.avif?t=1756112342\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously adding various policies and regulations to develop your combination into more tax revenue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912520?t=1756112342","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912520/a7e79237f8ecddda2d77e50edb36088e5c78e99b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756112342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912520/7993d58a82853b802835b1349048f926ce59e9e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756112342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912520/7993d58a82853b802835b1349048f926ce59e9e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756112342","categori